### =====================================================
### JWT LOGIN - CREATE ACCESS & REFRESH TOKEN
### =====================================================

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "aparna",
    "password": "aparna123"
}


### =====================================================
### REFRESH ACCESS TOKEN
### =====================================================

